{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, approach and take it, otherwise avoid obstacles and scan for object.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacles    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
    "BT": {
